{"availability":"available","full":"altink02/vela-career-portfolio","name":"vela-career-portfolio","description":"Portfolio case study for Vela — an AI-powered career platform for resumes, job matching, applications, and interview prep. Live demo included.","category":"Design","language":null,"stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-15T20:58:45Z","updated":"2026-10-13T19:03:20Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://vela-career.onrender.com","topics":["ai","authjs","career","job-search","nextjs","portfolio","postgresql","prisma","react","resume-builder","tailwindcss","typescript"],"demo":"https://vela-career.onrender.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:03.947Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:03.947Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T03:01:03.947Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T07:02:02.858Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:53.659Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-18T03:01:03.947Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An AI-assisted career platform for building resumes, matching jobs, tracking applications, and preparing for interviews.","Vela is a career workspace that treats a job search as a pipeline rather than a pile of documents. It combines resume authoring, job discovery with explainable match scoring, an application tracker, interview preparation, and an AI copilot behind a single account and entitlement model.","The product is built around one deliberate constraint: Vela prepares and explains; a human decides and submits. The apply workflow runs through explicit review gates and stops at a manual submission step. Vela does not automate browser submission to job boards, and the interface says so rather than implying otherwise."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/ulasmango-cmd/vela-career-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d94e3e9a0c1af2be0cad14679331102092b5e59892f67701462e38bca24b03f9","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T